    "sections": {
        "description": "Eco Store is a modern, SEO-friendly theme crafted for eco-conscious brands, organic shops, and sustainable businesses. Perfect for green startups, herbal stores, and natural product retailers, it supports niches like eco marketplace, organic market, biodegradable products, and fresh grocery delivery, including vegetables and plant-based goods. Its flexible and minimal design blends elegance with performance, making it ideal for eco eCommerce, green consulting, and lifestyle blogs. Built with clean, optimized code, it ensures fast loading, smooth navigation, and secure performance. The responsive layout delivers a seamless experience across all devices. Users can easily customize colors, fonts, and layouts without coding. Key features include product grids, testimonial sections, CTA buttons, and newsletter forms to boost engagement. With strong SEO structure and social integration, Eco Store helps businesses grow while promoting a natural, sustainable, and impactful online presence."
    },
